    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Render increasingly complex pixel art by wiring together visual logic nodes to split, shift, and merge pixels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744340/extras/f07ba8399ffe679064a3f6bc83d8dffb.poster.avif?t=1751807285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744340/extras/f07ba8399ffe679064a3f6bc83d8dffb.webm?t=1751807285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744340/extras/f07ba8399ffe679064a3f6bc83d8dffb.mp4?t=1751807285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>4-6 hours</strong> of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three chapters,</strong> each introducing new mechanics and ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of  <strong>quirky</strong> <strong>(and not-so-quirky)</strong> <strong>characters</strong> with ever more complex image requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classically inspired, experimental\u00a0<strong>synth soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>color styles</strong> to personalize your experience<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Render increasingly complex pixel art by wiring together visual logic nodes to split, shift, and merge pixels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744340/extras/f07ba8399ffe679064a3f6bc83d8dffb.poster.avif?t=1751807285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744340/extras/f07ba8399ffe679064a3f6bc83d8dffb.webm?t=1751807285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744340/extras/f07ba8399ffe679064a3f6bc83d8dffb.mp4?t=1751807285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>4-6 hours</strong> of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three chapters,</strong> each introducing new mechanics and ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of  <strong>quirky</strong> <strong>(and not-so-quirky)</strong> <strong>characters</strong> with ever more complex image requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classically inspired, experimental\u00a0<strong>synth soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>color styles</strong> to personalize your experience<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
